# Linux executes some of these files. A CR makes a shell script fail with
# 'bad interpreter: No such file or directory', and makes a .env value
# carry an invisible trailing \r that fails as a 401 looking exactly like
# a wrong key. Normalise on checkout so a Windows clone cannot cause it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Notebooks are large JSON; keep them out of diffs.
*.ipynb -diff
